# What the image build must never copy.
#
# `apps/web/dist` matters most: copying a locally built client would overwrite
# what the image builds itself, and ship whatever happened to be on the machine.
# Named precisely rather than as `**/dist`, which would also drop the placeholder
# the server embeds — and without it `go build` fails inside the image.
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
.git
.github
docs
var
